 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Privacy audit
+
+- The shared layout loads no third-party analytics, advertising scripts, remote fonts, or preconnections. Brand headings use installed serif fonts.
+- Account forms collect only a username and password and explain the external Google Cloud Functions destination before submission. JavaScript sends only those fields, omits cookies and referrers, rejects redirects, and disables request caching. Form markup uses POST so credentials cannot fall back to a query string before hydration. The external service may not support native form encoding; the normal flow requires JavaScript.
+- Password-manager autocomplete is supported. Password fields clear after completed requests, raw service errors are not rendered, and neither credentials nor returned tokens are persisted by the app. Tracking exclusions cover both forms and their fields as defense in depth.
+- Middleware applies `Referrer-Policy: no-referrer`, a restrictive `Permissions-Policy`, and `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`. HTML and reading-list responses use `Cache-Control: private, no-store`. The layout also declares the referrer policy for documents.
+- Reading lists are initialized on an explicit save, not on every visit. The privacy page describes remaining external image requests, demonstration cookies, and account-service limitations.
+
+The account service is outside this repository. Password hashing, rate limits, account data access/deletion, log scrubbing, retention periods, and authentication/session behavior must be verified with its operator before using real credentials. The current sign-in UI reports success but does not establish a local authenticated session. Intentional article debugging examples remain in place; this audit does not certify those examples or the hosting infrastructure as suitable for production personal data.
